          "text": "**1.** *Villalobos*\n**2.** *Villanueva*\n**3.** *Villaranda*\n**4.** *Villareal*\n**5.** *Villarin*"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Among the **Villar** names:\n\n**a** < **e** < **i**\n\nSo *Villarin* comes last."
        },
        {
          "type": "rule",
          "text": "When surnames share a long prefix, skip the common letters and compare the **first differing letter**."
        }
      ]
    }
  }
